        "_premotor_stance_sign_doc": "Joseph 2026-06-09 G-cal RE-VERIFICATION (yellow leg / code-side RR confirmed: u_hip1=+1 → posterior).  CORRECTED hip1 stance_signs from earlier [+1,-1,+1,-1] to [-1,+1,-1,+1].  Root cause of prior error: body LEG_COLORS at picrawler_body.gd:255 is FL=red FR=green RL=blue RR=yellow; my 2026-06-08 translation of Joseph's color-based empirical labels confused his color↔name mapping with the code's.  Correct translation: Joseph FL(green) = code FR (stance_sign=+1), Joseph FR(red) = code FL (-1), Joseph RL(yellow) = code RR (+1), Joseph RR(blue) = code RL (-1).  hip2 and knee uniform +1 per Joseph 'all correct and have the same sign per motion'.  Order matches premotor_ids: [FL_hip1, FR_hip1, RL_hip1, RR_hip1, FL_hip2, FL_knee, FR_hip2, FR_knee, RL_hip2, RL_knee, RR_hip2, RR_knee].",
