        ],
        "_premotor_joint_position_indices_doc": "Move 5 (2026-06-09) per-Premotor index into the reality.proprio.joints 12-channel vector.  Body publishes joints in joint-kind-grouped order: indices 0-3 = hip1 [FL,FR,RL,RR], 4-7 = hip2, 8-11 = knee.  Premotor_ids interleaves [FL_hip1, FR_hip1, RL_hip1, RR_hip1, FL_hip2, FL_knee, FR_hip2, FR_knee, RL_hip2, RL_knee, RR_hip2, RR_knee].  Mapping: [0,1,2,3, 4,8, 5,9, 6,10, 7,11].",
